{"description": "<div><body><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Opportunity</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">As a Level 2 Senior IP Support Engineer you will be managing the core IP network nodes and services. You will be responsible for troubleshooting issues, configuration changes, as well as controlling access to the network.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This role is part of a team of 3 L2 IP engineers and a bigger team of 14 engineers reporting to the same Team Lead, NOC, Engineering.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This role is based in Bucharest, with a hybrid work model requiring at least</span><b><strong style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> 2 days per week in the office</strong></b><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> (The Bridge 3, Sector 6).</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Key Responsibilities</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Implementation & Configuration:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Coordinate, support, and execute new implementations or changes to the existing standard services on IP areas and relevant internal tools;</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Change Management:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Follow the established Change Management process and ensure that all changes are tracked and properly documented. You will be responsible for creating and owning the change requests for any modifications you implement;</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Troubleshooting & Issue Resolution:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> You will schedule and participate in troubleshooting sessions with partners and customers when necessary.;</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Knowledge Transfer:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Participate in knowledge transfer sessions with other teams to stay updated on new solutions, product changes, or updates that affect this team’s implementation. Provide knowledge transfer when necessary to other teams;</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Documentation & Procedure Management</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: Maintain and regularly update the collection of implementation procedures to ensure they align with current best practices and technology updates. Act as the single point of contact for our partners regarding standard service requests related to IP domain implementations. Provide clear communication and timely resolutions;</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ticket Management:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Receive, acknowledge, and work on tickets raised by our customers and partners within the IP domain. You will be responsible for ensuring that tickets are handled efficiently and within the agreed-upon SLAs;</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Escalation Management:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Create, monitor, and follow-up on escalation tickets, directing them to the second-level or partner management teams when necessary. Ensure that issues are resolved within appropriate timelines and that stakeholders are kept informed. </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Qualifications</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Educational Background:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Completed education (University degree) in Telecommunications, Computer Science, or a related field is preferred;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience: Minimum of 3-5 years of experience in a network support or engineering role, particularly in </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">IP</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> networks.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Technical Skills:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience with network equipment and technologies such as Juniper, Ericsson, Extreme Networks (routers, switches, firewalls);</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong knowledge of VPN technologies (IPsec, MPLS VPN) and network configuration;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hands-on experience with network monitoring tools like Grafana, Cacti, or similar platforms;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Familiarity with DNS (BIND) and GGSN/PGW (Ericsson) services;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience using tracing tools for troubleshooting network issues.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Key Competencies:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Analytical technical thinking and problem-solving skills;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong communication and collaboration abilities;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Perseverance and a proactive approach to troubleshooting and documenting technical solutions;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ability to react quickly in a fast-paced environment and provide clear, effective support;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">A passion for advising, assisting, and developing others, with a professional and tactful approach;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ability to manage multiple tasks and prioritize effectively.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Language Proficiency:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Proficiency in English (both written and spoken). </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our Process</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">30 min Talent Team Discussion – Teams;</span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">60 min Interview with the Hiring Manager & N+1- On-Site.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><i><em style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please note that this reflects the current agreed interview process and may be adjusted or updated as the recruitment process progresses.</em></i><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><br><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Additional Benefits:</strong></b><span style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">25 + days Vacation; </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Health Insurance Private plan (EE+ Dependents); </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Life Insurance; </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lunch Allowance; </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Home Internet WFH supplement. </span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.38;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:0px 0px 10.6667px;padding:0px;text-align:left;'><i><em style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Aeris is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, religion, national origin, marital status, age, disability, veteran status, genetic information, or any other protected status.</em></i></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p></body></div>", "salary": "", "remote": true, "doar_remote": false, "nivel": "Middle (2-5 ani)", "limbi": []}